# Cloudflare Pages redirects for boxd-card.com
#
# The apex (docs/index.html) IS the web app — build output from src/web/, served
# directly as a static asset. Cloudflare Pages does not honor a `/ -> /x 200`
# rewrite (a fresh request to / returns 404; only the 301 rules apply), so
# whatever lives at the apex has to be a real file there rather than a rewrite.
#
# The marketing page lives at /about (docs/about/index.html).

# The web app used to be at /app/. Everything below it is gone, so a splat is
# safe here — send old links, bookmarks and store-listing references to the apex.
/app         /          301
/app/        /          301
/app/*       /          301

# The interim /landing/ path folds into /about.
# Exact matches only — do not use a splat here, or /landing/assets/* would break.
# Those assets are still live: docs/about/index.html references them by
# absolute path.
/landing       /about     301
/landing/      /about     301

# Legacy flat privacy path → new directory location.
/privacy.html  /privacy   301
